use flake

# Warn about an old nixpkgs pin, a newer release of a tag-pinned input, a
# newer exobrain CLI, and newer hook-set revisions. Then trim the Nix store and
# the prek cache of what nothing uses. Each line exits 0 and moves no pin. From
# a shell, `flake-edit update <input>` moves a tag pin, and
# `exobrain hooks sync --to <tag>` moves the hook revisions.
exobrain outdated || true
exobrain store-guard --daily || true

# Sync .venv from uv.lock with the host uv, and activate it.
layout uv

source_env_if_exists .envrc.local
